{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>All In One Memo 是一款隨身記錄工具，讓你隨時隨地保存文字、圖片、影片、語音與所在位置，並可設定提醒，避免遺漏重要事項。適合需要快速捕捉靈感、記錄行程或整理工作雜項的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費於 App Store 開放下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-8.webp\">\n<h2>文字語音位置一站記錄</h2>\n<p>開啟 All In One Memo 後，可即時輸入文字、拍攝圖片與影片、錄製語音，甚至記下當時位置，讓每則備忘保留完整情境。內建提醒會在指定時間通知你，重要事項不易錯過。所有記錄集中於同一介面，方便日後翻查整理，適合外出採訪、出差行程或日常採購使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-379-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-380-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-381-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-382-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：All In One Memo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.111851+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:25:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:37:35.810740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:09.579948+00:00","content_hash":"65cc0358e28d60b2f5acb50bf7080af1a6bad81eaef34fc9c3fc6e63f055bfba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}